OL,3,GNEWSACommunity 'absolutely gutted'
OL,4,Aafter skatepark vandalism
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community has been left upset after a
OL,7,Fskatepark was vandalised - with repairs
OL,8,Festimated to cost thousands of pounds.
OL,10,FMelksham Skatepark in Wiltshire opened
OL,11,Fin 2017 in King George V Park, after
OL,12,Fcampaigners raised #250,000 to
OL,13,Frefurbish the old skatepark.
OL,15,FOn Friday night, it was discovered
OL,16,Fparts of the skatepark had been
OL,17,Fvandalised, with large pieces of metal
OL,18,Fbroken off and rubbish strewn across
OL,19,Fthe site.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
