OL,3,GNEWSACommunity 'absolutely gutted'
OL,4,Aafter skatepark vandalism
OL,5,
OL,6,FHayley Bell, Melksham Town Council
OL,7,Fchief executive, said it would cost a
OL,8,F"significant amount of money" to get
OL,9,Fthe skatepark fixed because it had been
OL,10,Fbuilt by specialist contractors. She
OL,11,Fadded it was "really disheartening",
OL,12,Fwhile one of the original campaigners
OL,13,Fsaid he was "absolutely gutted".
